[{"client_msg_id":"88e0da68-d812-47b5-b3d4-6dbdb15561f3","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"どうでしょう…試してみよう…かな。","ts":"1618054907.117100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=cg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7D24CDDC-1978-4371-8287-F91846BAAAC5","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"アウトドアだと機能重視だから、メンズでサイズがなかったのかな？みたいな感じで済みそうな気もしますけど、どうでしょうねぇ。","ts":"1618054792.116300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DuzQL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"569da64e-c82c-4e7e-a567-9c0dcafc3402","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"今行こうと思っているのが田舎のアウトドアショップなので…","ts":"1618054443.114100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o86+d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"E3231067-F8E9-4C85-A5FC-F0BC386097DE","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"ブランドによっては最近だとユニセックスを意識してたりするので、完全女性向けでなければ店員さんも慣れてたりしますよ。","ts":"1618054401.113500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CRHF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c8a1b410-1217-46cd-b1dd-0a47d8cead09","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"やはりしますか。ヨーロッパサイズの女性物が合いそうだったので試してみたいと思いつつ、女性物ゾーンで品物を手に取るのに抵抗があって…","ts":"1618054313.112100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dSfnl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C78349ED-7558-41ED-9394-7F3E465509B3","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"例えばジャケットだと、丈はあってても肩幅が狭いとか。シャツだと、脇の下に加工があって綺麗にラインがでないとか。","ts":"1618054269.111700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5WOUF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D74D1EB1-93D7-4AF5-989C-0E4EF3A08488","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"僕はしてます。むしろ、男性もの以上にサイズや形（パターン）に違いがあるので、試着せずには買えないですね。","ts":"1618054173.109200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ISUf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc72bf43-5012-4bfd-a88e-a9e4e70a55a2","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"女性物を買われている方は試着も普通にされているんでしょうか？","ts":"1618053105.107300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qf="}]}]
